# Backend Architecture

- Clean architecture is mandatory for all services
- Business logic lives in `internal/usecase`
- Database access only in `internal/repository`
- HTTP handlers in `internal/handler` must remain thin
- Use interfaces for external dependencies
- Dependency injection via constructors in `cmd/server/main.go`
- Structured logging with zap and correlation IDs required
